WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.861
The friends went into the woods.

2
00:00:08.862 --> 00:00:12.825
"Camping is fun," said Dog.

3
00:00:12.826 --> 00:00:20.344
"We do not like camping," said Cat.

4
00:00:20.345 --> 00:00:24.532
"But we like you, Dog," said Bat.

5
00:00:24.533 --> 00:00:30.338
"So we are going camping," said Cow.

6
00:00:30.339 --> 00:01:19.669
The friends set up the tent.

7
00:01:19.670 --> 00:01:32.048
They had some snacks.

8
00:01:32.049 --> 00:01:48.403
They looked at stars.

9
00:01:48.404 --> 00:01:53.100
Then it was time for bed.

10
00:01:53.101 --> 00:02:13.723
They went into the tent.

11
00:02:13.724 --> 00:02:18.618
"It is very dark in here," said Cat.

12
00:02:18.619 --> 00:02:23.150
"It is very cold in here," said Bat.

13
00:02:23.151 --> 00:02:32.293
"It is very small in here," said Cow.

14
00:02:32.294 --> 00:02:39.220
"Are there more snacks?" said Pig.

15
00:02:39.221 --> 00:02:48.330
"What's that?" said Cat.

16
00:02:48.331 --> 00:02:51.450
"I hear something!"

17
00:02:51.451 --> 00:03:01.268
"Do not worry, Cat," said Dog.

18
00:03:01.269 --> 00:03:05.400
"It is just the wind."

19
00:03:05.401 --> 00:03:08.857
Then Dog got an idea.

20
00:03:08.858 --> 00:03:17.480
"Let's tell stories," said Dog.

21
00:03:17.481 --> 00:03:21.474
"Let's tell spooky stories!"

